==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|la}} {{term|resuscitatus}}, past participle of {{term|lang=la|resuscitare||to raise up again, revive}} < {{term|lang=la|re-||again}} + {{term|lang=la|suscitare||to raise up}} < {{term|lang=la|sus-}}, {{term|lang=la|sub-||up, under}} + {{term|lang=la|citare||to summon, rouse}}.

===Verb===
{{en-verb|resuscitat|ing}}

# {{transitive}} To [[restore]] [[consciousness]], [[vigor]], or [[life]] to.
# {{intransitive}} To [[regain]] [[consciousness]].

====Related terms====
* [[resuscitation]]
* [[resuscitative]]

